+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` categorizes billing questions. A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The classification identifies the question type only. It does not establish refund eligibility, approve or deny a refund, validate an invoice, or perform a billing change. Support responses to refund and invoice questions must remain grounded in available evidence and state when that evidence is insufficient.

